Subject: [PATCH 2/2] avcodec/libthorvgdec: add Lottie decoder via ThorVG

Wraps ThorVG C API to rasterise Lottie JSON frame by frame.
Packets carry a 4-byte LE frame index; JSON is in extradata.
Output: AV_PIX_FMT_RGBA. Canvas init deferred to first packet.
Adds AV_CODEC_ID_LOTTIE and thorvg-1 pkg-config dependency.
